msgid ""
"Disabled by default. Uses the global management VLAN, priority and ACS URL "
"for this device only, subject to management application authorization. "
"Disabling skips future OMCI management writes and retains existing ONU "
"settings. ME readback does not prove WAN creation or successful Inform; K155 "
"may clear its local ACS URL when enabled."
msgstr ""
"默认禁用。仅针对此设备使用全局管理 VLAN、优先级和 ACS URL，需经管理应用授权。禁用后将跳过后续 OMCI 管理写入并保留现有 ONU "
"设置。ME 回读不能作为 WAN 创建或 Inform 成功的凭证；K155 启用时可能会清除其本地 ACS URL。"

